From: The Fragata project <fragata-host@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] updater: use the Fragata Host update channel

The updater only queried the repositories of XCP-ng: on a Fragata Host it found no update. Query the
`fragata` repository too, and read the proxies from fragata.repo.

---
--- a/SOURCES/etc/xapi.d/plugins/updater.py	2026-11-02 15:45:45.598060600 -0300
+++ b/SOURCES/etc/xapi.d/plugins/updater.py	2026-11-02 15:45:45.830830600 -0300
@@ -12,7 +12,8 @@
 from xcpngutils.filelocker import FileLocker
 
 
-DEFAULT_REPOS = ('xcp-ng-base', 'xcp-ng-updates', 'xcp-ng-linstor')
+# Fragata Host: its channel first; the XCP-ng names are kept for the hosts still configured with them
+DEFAULT_REPOS = ('fragata', 'xcp-ng-base', 'xcp-ng-updates', 'xcp-ng-linstor')
 
 
 class OperationException(Exception):
@@ -232,7 +233,7 @@
     pass
 
 
-CONFIGURATION_FILE = '/etc/yum.repos.d/xcp-ng.repo'
+CONFIGURATION_FILE = '/etc/yum.repos.d/fragata.repo'
 
 
 # returns a JSON dict {repo_id: proxy}
